+// this fork's upstream schematic, there is no PC13/TJA1051-S line to drive
+// here. can_set_silent() below still switches CAN_MODE_SILENT at the
+// peripheral level; only the transceiver-level GPIO toggle is removed.
 
 
 // Initialize CAN peripheral settings, but don't actually start the peripheral
